  "description": "Saetbyeol had a lot on his plate: he's an omega who hates alphas, his mom is constantly causing trouble, and his high school boyfriend is a jerk. Naturally, he ran off and hid himself after graduation to live a new life away from these problems. But one day, he runs into Hyeontae, a friend from his past that he's been running from for so long. It shouldn't be a big problem though, since Hyeontae's a beta who just wants to be a good friend...or is he? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
